      "content": "BugFix:\n1. Fixed the problem of screen tearing of some transition animations.\n\nFeatures:\n1. The game supports English language now. You can change the language in the game setting.\n2. Added A new animation telling the heroine's story. It can be unlocked and viewed in the \u201cAchievements-CG\u201d after completing the corresponding battle.\n3. Added English and Traditional Chinese description for Steam achievement.\n\nOptimization: \n1. Adjusted the play speed of some of the transitional animations.\n2. Adjusted the description of some achievements.\n\n\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40774150/14fe77e368d607e1b065eda757099120d50d3725.jpg[/img]",
