          "bug": "1. Fixed the problem of screen tearing of some transition animations."
        },
        {
          "feature": "1. The game supports English language now. You can change the language in the game setting."
        },
        {
          "feature": "2. Added A new animation telling the heroine's story. It can be unlocked and viewed in the \u201cAchievements-CG\u201d after completing the corresponding battle."
        },
        {
          "feature": "3. Added English and Traditional Chinese description for Steam achievement."
        }
      ]
